# kickstart build settings. Copy to .env and uncomment what you need.
# Contributors: update internal/buildenv and run `go tool task generate`.
#
# Every assignment below is commented out on purpose. This file documents
# the settings; it does not supply them. Copy it whole to .env and nothing
# is configured, so every default below stays in force.

# ///// VERSION /////

# SemVer string stamped into the binary and reported by the version flag.
#
# Unset: the version comes from git describe, or 0.0.0-dev outside a
# repository.
#VERSION=1.4.2

# ///// REPO_OWNER /////

# GitHub owner stamped into the binary, used to build release and issue
# URLs.
#
# Unset: the owner is read from the origin remote, and is empty until the
# repo is published.
#REPO_OWNER=your-github-user

# ///// REPO_NAME /////

# GitHub repository name, stamped alongside REPO_OWNER.
#
# Unset: the name is read from the origin remote, and is empty until the
# repo is published.
#REPO_NAME=your-repo
